usage: run_regression.py [-h] --output OUTPUT [--workers WORKERS]
                         [--package PACKAGE] [--modules MODULES [MODULES ...]]

Run regression modules in separate processes; retain module logs under build.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --workers WORKERS
  --package PACKAGE
  --modules MODULES [MODULES ...]
                        Optional explicit modules; report is then a subset
